          "id": "c",
          "text": "A construction manager participates in design and guarantees maximum price, which is more characteristic of CM at Risk"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "All parties share risk, reward, and decision-making equally, which is not a feature of Design-Bid-Build"
        }
